<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">

    <p>Hi {!Receiving_User.FirstName},</p>

    <p>
      One of your customer Quotes has expired.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Key Details:</strong></p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Quote Number:</strong> {!Quote.QuoteNumber}</li>
      <li><strong>Customer:</strong> {!Quote.Account}</li>
      <li><strong>Quote Value:</strong> {!Quote.TotalPrice}</li>
      <li><strong>Expiry Date:</strong> {!Quote.ExpirationDate}</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Please review the expired Quote in Salesforce and contact the customer
      if a revised Quote is required.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="{!Quote.Link}">{!Quote.QuoteNumber}</a>
    </p>

    <p>
      Thank you,<br>
      Carlton Packaging CRM
    </p>

  </body>
</html>